        524.409,
        152.324
      ],
      "char_start": 228881,
      "char_end": 229062,
      "text": "[SWS_Com_00816] ⌈The AUTOSAR COM module shall forward all data of the re-\nceived I-PDU (i.e. the complete I-PDU as provided by the PduR) in the Com_RxIpdu-\nCallout.⌋(SRS_Com_02037)\n"
    },
