        294.681
      ],
      "char_start": 229311,
      "char_end": 229362,
      "text": "Parameters (in)\nPduId\nID of the transmitted I-PDU.\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 11,
      "bbox": [
        77.342,
        300.609,
        511.507,
        318.085
      ],
      "char_start": 229362,
      "char_end": 229502,
      "text": "Parameters (inout)\nPduInfoPtr\nContains the length (SduLength) of the transmitted I-PDU and a\npointer to the data of the I-PDU (SduDataPtr).\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 12,
      "bbox": [
        77.342,
        323.947,
        201.21,
        332.059
      ],
      "char_start": 229502,
      "char_end": 229524,
      "text": "Parameters (out)\nNone\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 13,
      "bbox": [
        77.342,
        337.886,
        447.61,
        355.321
      ],
      "char_start": 229524,
      "char_end": 229629,
      "text": "Return value\nboolean\ntrue: I-PDU will be processed normal\nfalse: I-PDU will not be processed any further\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 14,
      "bbox": [
        77.342,
        361.325,
        503.077,
        378.801
      ],
      "char_start": 229629,
      "char_end": 229820,
      "text": "Description\nThe I-PDU callout on sender side can be configured for example to implement user-defined\ntransmission filtering or user-defined pre-transmission-processing of the outgoing I-PDU.\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 15,
      "bbox": [
        77.342,
        384.901,
        356.945,
        392.912
      ],
      "char_start": 229820,
      "char_end": 229879,
      "text": "Available via\nConfiguration parameter ComUserCbkHeaderFile\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 16,
      "bbox": [
        70.866,
        409.255,
        180.489,
        421.506
      ],
      "char_start": 229879,
      "char_end": 229896,
      "text": "⌋(SRS_Com_02037)\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 17,
      "bbox": [
        70.866,
        431.49,
        518.908,
        458.368
      ],
      "char_start": 229896,
      "char_end": 230003,
      "text": "The callout function name must be configured either by ComIPduCallout or by\nComIPduTriggerTransmitCallout.\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 18,
      "bbox": [
        70.866,
        468.829,
        524.411,
        524.121
      ],
      "char_start": 230003,
      "char_end": 230329,
      "text": "The AUTOSAR COM module implements no means to detect or prevent possible re-\ncursions that may occur when I-PDUs are triggered by actions within an I-PDU callout.\nIt is solely in the responsibility of the implementer of an I-PDU callout and the system\nintegrator that unwanted or endless chains of I-PDU callouts are avoided.\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 19,
      "bbox": [
        70.866,
        534.286,
        524.414,
        589.875
      ],
      "char_start": 230329,
      "char_end": 230579,
      "text": "[SWS_Com_00381] ⌈The AUTOSAR COM module shall not support that other\nAUTOSAR COM module’s APIs than Com_TriggerIPDUSend, Com_TriggerIP-\nDUSendWithMetaData, Com_SendSignal and Com_SendSignalGroup can be\ncalled out of an I-PDU callout.⌋(SRS_Com_02037)\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 20,
      "bbox": [
        70.866,
        599.859,
        524.411,
        655.628
      ],
      "char_start": 230579,
      "char_end": 230823,
      "text": "[SWS_Com_00766] ⌈In case ComIPduTriggerTransmitCallout is configured for\nan I-PDU and the I-PDU is started, the AUTOSAR COM module shall invoke this I-\nPDU callout within every execution of Com_TriggerTransmit for this I-PDU.⌋(SRS_-\nCom_02037)\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 21,
      "bbox": [
        70.866,
        665.612,
        524.41,
        706.936
      ],
      "char_start": 230823,
      "char_end": 230986,
      "text": "[SWS_Com_00395] ⌈When Com_TriggerTransmit is called, the AUTOSAR COM\nmodule shall ignore the return value from the ComIPduTriggerTransmitCallout.⌋\n(SRS_Com_02037)\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 22,
      "bbox": [
        70.866,
        716.92,
        524.41,
        772.689
      ],
      "char_start": 230986,
      "char_end": 231232,
      "text": "[SWS_Com_00719] ⌈In case a ComIPduCallout is configured for an I-PDU with\nComIPduDirection configured to SEND, the AUTOSAR COM module shall invoke\nthis I-PDU callout directly before the I-PDU is transmitted via PduR_ComTransmit.⌋\n(SRS_Com_02037)\n"
    },
